            SingularClosure.SpectralSolenoidal (SingularClosure.datumFourierCoeff (u t)) ∧
              SingularClosure.SpectralMeanZero (SingularClosure.datumFourierCoeff (u t))
TYPE_END:QuasiFeffermanB.LH_POSITIVE_TRACE_FOURIER_CONSTRAINTS
